<title>SRI LANKA: National Development dips 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>National Development dips 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of the blue chip National Development Bank Ltd fell 5.9 percent or 14.75 rupees to 235 on profit-taking, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are taking profit since the share rose to a high of 275 rupees in the recent rally,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>National Development Bank is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
